# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HTN-Concord — .gitignore
#
# Contribution #1 of this project is a reproducible, open-source guideline
# engine. That means this repo must be safe to publish. Two categories must
# NEVER be committed:
#
#   1. Credentialed data (MIMIC-IV, MIMIC-IV-ED, MIMIC-IV-Note, eICU-CRD,
#      Zigong HF). PhysioNet credentialing forbids redistribution. ~60 GB.
#   2. Copyrighted publisher materials (the PREVENT paper and its supplements).
#
# Derived artifacts are excluded too: they are reproducible from the pipelines,
# and NHANES/MIMIC-derived profiles are patient-level rows regardless of the
# public status of the upstream survey.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── 1. Credentialed source data (NEVER commit) ───────────────────────────────
Data/
data/raw/

# ── 2. Copyrighted reference material (NEVER commit) ─────────────────────────
# Khan 2024 PREVENT paper + supplements. The PREVENT coefficients in
# pipelines/nhanes/prevent.py were transcribed from Supplemental Table S12A;
# the transcription is unit-tested against the paper's published worked example
# (women 14.684% / men 16.317%), so correctness is verifiable without shipping
# the source document. Acquire it separately: Circulation 2024;149:430-449.
*.pdf
*.docx
*.xlsx
htn-concord/references/

# ── 3. Derived data artifacts (reproducible; may contain patient-level rows) ──
# Regenerate with the pipelines. Provenance comes from the HC-9 run manifest,
# not from committing outputs. NB: this also excludes the per-source QA reports
# (data/*/qa/) per the documented convention — revisit if you decide QA reports
# should be versioned as review evidence.
htn-concord/data/

# ── 4. Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ── 5. Secrets & local config ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model API keys will be needed from HC-60 (the runner) onward.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
credentials.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── 6. OS / editor noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
